      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY \n\nIN CONNECTION WITH PROTEST BEING HELD AT CHANDGI RAM AKHARA, MGM (RING ROAD) ON 04.08.25 \n\nA Protest is being held on 04.08.2025 from 1130 hours at Chandgiram Akhara MGM (Ring Road).Due to the protest, traffic will remain affected on MGM (Ring Road) on 04.08.2025 from 11:30 AM onwards for general road users except emergency vehicles.\n\nDIVERSION POINTS: -\n1.     I.P College Red Light\n2.Chandgiram Akhara.\n\nAll vehicles will be diverted from the above points as and when required.\n\nALTERNATE ROUTE:-\nTraffic coming from ISBT Kashmiri Gate and Majnu Ka Tila on Chandigram Akhara :-\n\nThe traffic destined to I.P College and P. S Civil Lines from Outer Ring Road (ISBT Kashmiri gate) will be diverted from Chandgiram Akhara to Outer Ring Road -Baba Gopal Sahib Talab Road- Khyber Pass Red light and then take Mall road to reach their destinations.\n\nThe traffic destined to I.P College and P.S Civil Lines from Ouetr Ring Road (Majnu Ka Tila) will be diverted from Chandgiram Akhara to Outer Ring Road towards ISBT Kashmiri Gate.\n\nTraffic coming from Khyber Pass and Shamnath Marg on Chandgiram Akhara:-\n\nThe traffic destined to ISBT from Khyber Pass will be diverted from I.P College Red Light to Shamnath Marg and then take Boulevard Road to reach their destinations.\nThe traffic destined to ISBT from Shamnath Marg will be diverted from I.P College Red Light to MGM P.S Civil Lines Red Light –Khyber Pass- Baba Gopal Sahib Talab Road and then take Outer Ring Road to reach their destinations.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS TO GENERAL PUBLIC: -\n1.    Commuters are advised to avoid the above roads.\n2.Avoid roadside parking as it causes hindrance to    normal flow of traffic.",
